{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本多地繼續受強烈寒流影響，過千人被困。</p><p></p><p>在福島縣裡磐梯地區，因大雪令樹木倒塌阻塞公路，令900多名居民，以及約500名旅客被困，當局後來打通一條行車線，讓旅客陸續離開。</p><p></p><p>據報有數百戶停電，旅館因暖氣中斷，要發放毛毯給住客使用，餐廳要點蠟燭，區內亦無法接收手機信號，後來電力供應恢復。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:43:49.931608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T13:37:12.152968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:16.109780+00:00","content_hash":"ccbfdcb98ff63660ba7e05a755e2d84b4898aba8cffa31b51eb809d1e5a3e88c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:43:49.931608+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}